<title>ISRAEL: Netanyahu demands Arafat &quot;stop the incitement&quot;.</title>
<headline>Netanyahu demands Arafat &quot;stop the incitement&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu said on Friday that Palestinian President Yasser Arafat must personally intervene to stop what the Israeli leader called incitement.</p>
<p>&quot;He must personally intervene and stop the incitement so it is heard from him,&quot; Netanyahu told a news conference.</p>
</text>
